# Installation Instructions:
# 1. Create virtual environment: python -m venv .venv
# 2. Activate: .venv\Scripts\activate (Windows) or source .venv/bin/activate (Mac/Linux)
# 3. Install dependencies: pip install -r requirements.txt
# 4. Run app: streamlit run webapp.py
#
#
#
# For Development:
# pip install -r requirements.txt
# pip install -r requirements-dev.txt  # If dev requirements exist
#
# For Production:
# pip install -r requirements.txt --no-cache-dir --upgrade
#
# Update Dependencies:
# pip list --outdated
# pip install -U -r requirements.txt